freedomnas-installer (4.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * ZFS-on-root installer: disk partitioning, ZFS pool/dataset setup,
    base system install, user and package configuration
  * Boot chain: dracut-built Unified Kernel Image (UKI), loaded directly
    via efibootmgr on UEFI or via Clover on legacy BIOS
  * Replaces the previous GRUB + bpool boot chain

 -- FreedomNAS Team <dev@freedomnas.io>  Thu, 16 Jul 2026 15:00:00 +0000
